1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:03,539
For God's sakes, Sheldon,
you are driving me crazy.

2
00:00:03,707 --> 00:00:06,047
Your anger is not with me,
but with mathematics.

3
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:07,960
I'm pretty sure my anger is with you.

4
00:00:08,128 --> 00:00:10,838
What is happening to us?
We're falling apart.

5
00:00:12,549 --> 00:00:15,009
- Who are you calling?
- The only man who can restore...

6
00:00:15,177 --> 00:00:17,677
(Sheldon:)...any semblance of balance
to our universe.

7
00:00:17,846 --> 00:00:19,346
HOWARD [ON RECORDING]:
This is Howard.

8
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:21,015
CHRISTY [ON RECORDING]
This is Christy.

9
00:00:21,183 --> 00:00:24,933
HOWARD: We can't get to the phone
right now because we're having sex.

10
00:00:27,022 --> 00:00:29,402
CHRISTY: You're not gonna put that
on your message, are you?

11
00:00:29,566 --> 00:00:31,316
HOWARD:
I'm just kidding. I'll re-record it.

12
00:00:31,485 --> 00:00:32,525
[BEEPS]

13
00:00:35,197 --> 00:00:36,527
(Leonard:)Sheldon, think this through.

14
00:00:36,698 --> 00:00:39,698
(Leonard:)You're going to ask Howard
to choose between sex and "Halo."

15
00:00:39,868 --> 00:00:43,538
(Sheldon:)No, I'm going to ask him
to choose between sex and "Halo 3."

16
00:00:44,039 --> 00:00:46,129
(Sheldon:)As far as I know,
sex has not been upgraded...

17
00:00:46,291 --> 00:00:49,461
...to include hi-def graphics
and enhanced weapon systems.

18
00:00:49,628 --> 00:00:53,258
(Leonard:)You're right, all sex has is nudity,
orgasms and human contact.

19
00:00:53,715 --> 00:00:55,385
(Sheldon:)My point.

